  "supplier30_review": "The contract explicitly assumes a square-integrable all-pairs M=N-A and E A_T<infinity, finite horizon, simple unit jumps, predictable Y/lambda and continuous A. Brackets are proved with finite-variation partition identities and stopped-grid event tests, sampled discrete Doob only providing a maximal bound. Density uses the predictable generator pi-system and finite compensator measure. The extension uses L2 completion, finite energy E integral H^2 dA<infinity, fixed-time F_t-measurable classes and conditional-expectation contraction. No path regularity for extended integrals beyond the asserted all-pairs martingale, compensator existence from intensity alone, infinite-energy isometry or continuous-time martingale CLT is inferred. Zero cross brackets use common filtration and no simultaneous jumps, not independence. Final17 bodies including exponential, delayed-entry and tied-jump examples inspected.",
